        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "**قول الوقت:**\n\n- **What time is it?** = كم الساعة؟\n- 6:00 = It's **six o'clock**.\n- 6:30 = It's **six thirty** (أو half past six).\n- 6:15 = It's **six fifteen** (أو quarter past six).\n- مع الوقت نستخدم **at**: at seven o'clock. ومع أجزاء اليوم **in**: in the morning, in the evening. لكن **at night**."
